<title>JAPAN: Toshiba files 250 bln yen shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Toshiba files 250 bln yen shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toshiba Corp said on Thursday it had filed a shelf registration with the Finance Ministry to issue up to 250 billion yen of corporate bonds, effective for two years from January 21.</p>
</text>
